546
00:47:48,492 --> 00:47:53,712
前半の曲は去年の夏にリリースされた新曲「地球系説得音頭」！
The first half song was the new song released last summer, "Chikyuu-kei Settoku Ondo"!

547
00:47:54,092 --> 00:47:57,852
やっぱ夏といえばね、私たちUMISEAでしょっていうことでね、ええ。
After all, when it comes to summer, it's us UMISEA, right? So, yeah.

548
00:47:58,352 --> 00:48:02,392
ENの2人にも特別ゲストとして出演しても…しゅ、しゅーとさんとわきだしよ。
We also had the two EN members appear as special guests... Shuu-to-san and wakidashi yo.

