599
00:52:48,080 --> 00:52:53,080
迎えたイマは当たり前なんかじゃない 翼を広げさあ今飛ぼう！
The present we've welcomed isn't just something to take for granted. Spread your wings and let's fly now!

600
00:52:53,580 --> 00:52:55,080
take my hand !
Take my hand!

601
00:52:55,580 --> 00:53:00,080
連れて行くよ！光の真ん中 夢の先へ
I'll take you! To the center of the light, beyond our dreams.

602
00:53:00,080 --> 00:53:04,580
羽ばたける勇気はキミの願い 皆で繋いだこの奇跡が
The courage to spread our wings is your wish, and this miracle we wove together...

603
00:53:04,580 --> 00:53:10,080
途切れないように歌うんだ もっと高く！大きな声で
We'll keep singing so it never fades, higher and higher with a loud voice!

604
00:53:11,080 --> 00:53:17,080
僕らの未来彩ってどこまでも響け！ prism melody
Color our future and echo everywhere! Prism Melody!

605
00:53:17,580 --> 00:53:23,080
そうさ君と僕らの奇跡は終わらないよ
That's right, our miracle with you will never end!

606
00:53:23,580 --> 00:53:29,080
涙さえきっかけに変えていこう 信じてくれる仲間と一緒に
Let's turn even our tears into a catalyst, together with friends who believe in us!

607
00:53:29,580 --> 00:53:35,080
どこへだって飛び出していこう もっと遠く空を越えて
Let's burst out anywhere, further away across the sky!

608
00:53:35,580 --> 00:53:41,580
翼を広げさあ今飛ぼう！光の真ん中夢の先へ
Spread your wings and let's fly now, to the center of the light beyond our dreams!

609
00:54:12,080 --> 00:54:20,080
未来の僕らにまだ見ぬキミに伝えたいことたくさんあるんだ
There's so much I want to tell our future selves and the yet-unseen you.

610
