We'll keep singing so this miracle we wove together never fades, higher and higher with a loud voice!

615
00:55:00,210 --> 00:55:02,670
暗闇の未来いろどって
Coloring the dark future,

616
00:55:02,670 --> 00:55:06,990
どこまでも響け リズム メロディ
resound everywhere, rhythm melody!

617
00:55:48,888 --> 00:55:51,588
ちょっとそこ行く 南の皆様よ
Hey you folks over there, everyone from the south!

618
00:55:51,788 --> 00:55:54,888
僕らと一緒に 踊らない？
Won't you dance along with us?

619
00:55:55,288 --> 00:55:58,388
さあ お手を拝借
Now, lend us your hands!

620
00:55:58,788 --> 00:56:01,588
ポポン ガポン はい！
Popon gapon, hey!

621
00:56:02,188 --> 00:56:06,188
ちょうちん灯れば 笑顔集どぅ
When paper lanterns light up, smiles gather.

622
00:56:06,988 --> 00:56:11,188
ホロメン音頭 (あーよいしょ)
Horomen Ondo (Ah, yoisho!)

623
00:56:11,988 --> 00:56:16,188
うちわ わたあめ かき氷 だね
Paper fans, cotton candy, and shaved ice.

624
00:56:16,988 --> 00:56:21,188
バーリラ バーリラ ワンコも踊る (そーれ)
Barira barira, even doggies dance (Sore!)

625
00:56:22,088 --> 00:56:25,588
みんな揃って どどんがどどん
Everyone gathering, dodon ga dodon,

626
00:56:25,988 --> 00:56:31,088
まつり囃子だ どどんがどどん
Festival music playing, dodon ga dodon!

627
00:56:33,288 --> 00:56:35,588
よいしょ あーどっこい
Yoisho! Ah, dokkoi!

628
00:56:37,088 --> 00:56:41,088
あかね くなし わかなえ しおん
Akane, Kunashi, Wakanae, Shion...

629
00:56:42,088 --> 00:56:46,088
ホロメン音頭 (あーよいしょ)
Horomen Ondo (Ah, yoisho!)

630
00:56:47,088 --> 00:56:50,988
浴衣 あざやか 花吹雪 だね
Vibrant yukatas and a flurry of flower petals.

631
00:56:51,388 --> 00:56:55,588
バーリラ バーリラ 金魚も踊る (そーれ)
Barira barira, even goldfish dance (Sore!)

632
00:56:56,088 --> 00:57:00,088
みんな揃って どどんがどどん
Everyone gathering, dodon ga dodon,

633
00:57:00,588 --> 00:57:05,588
まつり囃子だ どどんがどどん
Festival music playing, dodon ga dodon!

634
00:57:07,088 --> 00:57:11,588
ホロメンを集めて囃し 保護者かな
Gathering Holomembers and cheering them on, like a guardian?

635
00:57:11,588 --> 00:57:15,888
推しのことだね 満ちる幸せ
It's about my oshi, filling me with happiness.

636
00:57:17,388 --> 00:57:20,588
「さぁさぁ皆さん、音頭を踊れば温度が上がる！」
"Come on everyone, dancing the ondo raises the temperature!"

637
00:57:21,188 --> 00:57:25,588
「赤ん坊から閑かん坊まで、誰でもいらっしゃれ～！」
"From babies to the elderly, everyone is welcome!"

638
00:57:26,188 --> 00:57:29,088
あぁ、こまけぇこたぁいいんだよ
Ah, the details don't matter!

639
00:57:29,988 --> 00:57:33,888
今宵の祭 シャル・ウィ・ダンス
Tonight's festival, Shall We Dance?

640
00:57:34,288 --> 00:57:37,588
踊り踊らば はっぴっぴー
When we dance and dance, we're happy-happy!

641
00:57:42,188 --> 00:57:46,588
ヨヨイ宵の口 西明かり遠か
Evening begins, the western twilight is far away.

642
00:57:47,588 --> 00:57:50,588
ホロメン音頭 (あーよいしょ)
Horomen Ondo (Ah, yoisho!)

643
00:57:51,888 --> 00:57:55,888
光りざめく 天の川 だね
Sparkling Milky Way.

644
00:57:56,188 --> 00:58:00,088
バーリラ バーリラ ばあばも踊る (そーれ)
Barira barira, even grannies dance (Sore!)

645
00:58:01,088 --> 00:58:05,088
みんな揃って どどんがどどん
Everyone gathering, dodon ga dodon,

646
00:58:05,588 --> 00:58:10,588
まつり囃子だ どどんがどどん
Festival music playing, dodon ga dodon!

647
00:58:13,288 --> 00:58:15,588
よいしょ はーどっこい
Yoisho! Ha, dokkoi!

648
00:58:16,588 --> 00:58:20,588
目引き袖引き ご一緒いかが
Pulling eyes and sleeves, won't you join us?

649
00:58:22,088 --> 00:58:25,088
ホロメン音頭 (あーよいしょ)
Horomen Ondo (Ah, yoisho!)

650
00:58:26,588 --> 00:58:30,588
花火 ヒュルリラ 夏の夜 だね
Fireworks whistling, it's a summer night.

651
00:58:31,288 --> 00:58:35,588
バーリラ バーリラ わらべも踊る (そーれ)
Barira barira, even children dance (Sore!)

652
00:58:36,188 --> 00:58:40,088
みんな揃って どどんがどどん
Everyone gathering, dodon ga dodon,

653
00:58:40,588 --> 00:58:45,588
まつり囃子だ どどんがどどん
Festival music playing, dodon ga dodon!

654
00:58:46,288 --> 00:58:50,588
(はぁ～てぇてぇなぁ！てぇてぇなぁ！両手を合わせ てぇてぇなぁ！)
(Ha~ precious! Precious! Put your hands together, precious!)

655
00:58:51,188 --> 00:58:55,588
(てぇてぇなぁ！てぇてぇなぁ！両手を合わせ てぇてぇなぁ！)
(Precious! Precious! Put your hands together, precious!)

656
00:58:57,188 --> 00:59:01,188
ひょいと見上げりゃ 望月にこり
Glance up and see the smiling harvest moon.

657
00:59:02,188 --> 00:59:05,088
ホロメン音頭 (あーよいしょ)
Horomen Ondo (Ah, yoisho!)

658
00:59:06,288 --> 00:59:10,588
少し切ない 夢心地 だね
A slightly bittersweet dreamlike feeling.

659
00:59:11,188 --> 00:59:15,588
バーリラ バーリラ 夜っぴて踊る (そーれ)
Barira barira, dancing all through the night (Sore!)

660
00:59:16,188 --> 00:59:20,088
みんな揃って どどんがどどん
Everyone gathering, dodon ga dodon,

661
00:59:20,588 --> 00:59:25,588
まつり囃子だ どどんがどどん
Festival music playing, dodon ga dodon!

662
00:59:44,288 --> 00:59:47,888
はい、ということで お祭りでしたー！
Alright, and that concludes our festival!

663
01:00:00,416 --> 01:00:04,376
さあさあさあさあ、早速でまずは自己紹介からしていきたいと思います！
Now then, let's start with self-introductions!

664
01:00:06,816 --> 01:00:10,816
一番、すばるです！おねがいします！そして！
First, it's Subaru! Nice to meet you! And—

665
01:00:11,936 --> 01:00:16,896
ホロライブゲーマーズ、戌神ころね！や、指々！よろしくおねがいします！
Hololive Gamers, Inugami Korone! Y-, finger-finger! Nice to meet you!

666
01:00:16,896 --> 01:00:17,776
そしてからの…
And then...

667
01:00:18,096 --> 01:00:23,096
注目せよ！我が輩の名前は…ラプラス・ダークネスだ。
Pay attention! My name is... La+ Darkness.

668
01:00:24,096 --> 01:00:24,736
あ、続いては？
Ah, next is?

669
01:00:25,056 --> 01:00:34,656
おい！一番、ゆびゆび！注目せよ！えー、こよ…あ、ホロライブ４期の常闇トワでーす！
Hey! First, finger-finger! Pay attention! Uh, Koyo... Ah, I'm Hololive 4th Gen's Tokoyami Towa!

670
01:00:36,496 --> 01:00:46,096
ということでですね、以上のメンバーでホロライブ夏祭り2022の新曲「ホロメン音頭」をお送りしました！
So, with these members, we delivered the new song "Holomen Ondo" for Hololive Summer 2022!

671
01:00:47,296 --> 01:00:53,456
いやー、ていうか今までなかったそういう曲だったから、すごい新鮮だったよね。
Man, since we didn't have a song quite like this before, it felt really fresh.

672
01:00:54,336 --> 01:01:03,296
しかも、なんとこのフ、あ、この曲を公式ショップで買うと、なんと！お祭りで使えるんだぞ、みんなの！
Moreover, if you buy this song at the official shop, guess what! You can use it at the festival, everyone!

673
01:01:03,296 --> 01:01:03,896
やったー！
Yay!

674
01:01:05,216 --> 01:01:10,656
ラプちゃん読めたね！読めたね！
Lap-chan, you read it! You read it!

675
01:01:11,696 --> 01:01:17,856
まあね、今年はもうだから、来年とかでも使ってもらえたらなと思います！
Well, since it's already this year, I hope people will use it next year and beyond!

676
01:01:18,256 --> 01:01:25,096
はい、ということでですね、詳しくはホロライブ夏祭り2022の公式ショップから確認してみてください！お願いします！
Yes, so please check the official Hololive Summer 2022 shop for details! Please do!

677
01:01:26,656 --> 01:01:31,296
お、で、せっかくだから、なんと！浴衣なのだ！
Oh, and since we're wearing yukatas!

678
01:01:31,296 --> 01:01:35,096
せっかくだから、スクショをとろう！せーの！
Let's take a screenshot! Ready, set!

679
01:01:36,896 --> 01:01:41,296
かっこいいの。かっこいいの。
A cool one. A cool one.

680
01:01:42,016 --> 01:01:47,456
それでは、じゃあ、エスワイダン、決めていきます！
Now then, let's strike an "EsuwAIDan" pose!

681
01:01:49,696 --> 01:02:07,096
せーの、注目せよ！エスワイダン！
Ready, set, pay attention! EsuwAIDan!

682
01:02:10,496 --> 01:02:18,096
はい、ということでですね、えー、なんとですね、ちょっと早いんですけど、次がね、最後の曲みたいで！
Yes, so, um, surprisingly, although it's a bit early, it looks like the next song is the last one!

683
01:02:18,976 --> 01:02:32,896
ま、でもね、ちょっと名残惜しいんですけど、で、も最後はやっぱりね、あのホロライブ夏祭り2022の新曲３つ目の新曲で終わりみたいですよ！
Well, it's a bit bittersweet, but it seems the final song will be the third new song of Hololive Summer 2022!

684
01:02:33,216 --> 01:02:39,296
ちなみに、この曲が終わった後、みなさん帰らないでください！
By the way, after this song finishes, everyone, please don't leave!

685
01:02:39,296 --> 01:02:43,096
なんか、すごいサプライズが待ってるみたいですね！
It seems like an amazing surprise is waiting for us!

686
01:02:52,416 --> 01:02:55,296
はい、というわけで、みなさん気になってると思うので、早速次の曲にいっちゃいましょう！
Yes, so since I think everyone's curious, let's jump right into the next song!

687
01:02:55,596 --> 01:03:05,536
クライマックスストーリーライブのトリを飾る曲は！…せーの、こちら！
The song closing out the climax story live is— Ready, set, here it is!

688
01:03:17,296 --> 01:03:22,096
夏が何度巡り来ても
No matter how many summers come around,

689
01:03:22,096 --> 01:03:27,596
忘れないでいたい
I want to never forget them.

690
01:03:38,296 --> 01:03:44,296
少し寂しいと思ったんだ
I thought it was a little lonely,

691
01:03:44,896 --> 01:03:49,296
浴衣の袖を揺らす
swaying the sleeves of my yukata.

692
01:03:49,896 --> 01:03:54,896
「風が涼しいね」なんて言った
As you said, "The breeze is cool,"

693
01:03:55,096 --> 01:03:59,896
君の表情見つけたせいかな
was it because I caught sight of your expression?

694
01:04:00,896 --> 01:04:06,896
日が暮れるまではしゃいで笑ってるの
Laughing and playing until the sun goes down,

695
01:04:07,196 --> 01:04:12,596
オレンジが映ったシルエット
an orange-tinted silhouette.

696
01:04:12,896 --> 01:04:17,896
蝉の歌声や 波の騒ぎが
Cicadas' song and the roar of the waves

697
01:04:17,896 --> 01:04:24,096
遠くなっていったって きっと思い出せる
faded into the distance, but I'm sure I'll remember.

698
01:04:26,596 --> 01:04:30,896
祭りの夜の空を見ると
When I look up at the festival night sky,

699
01:04:31,596 --> 01:04:36,096
まるで思い出の数だけ
it's as if the number of memories

700
01:04:37,096 --> 01:04:41,596
色が光っているみたいだね
are shining in different colors.

701
01:04:42,096 --> 01:04:47,896
一つ一つ綺麗に 咲いて咲いて行くよ
Blooming, blooming, one by one, so beautifully.

702
01:05:01,104 --> 01:05:03,304
新しい浴衣着替えて
Changing into a new yukata,

703
01:05:04,604 --> 01:05:06,904
「どうかな？」って見せ合ったり
"How do I look?" you asked with a spin.

704
01:05:10,604 --> 01:05:12,404
気温のせいにしちゃって
Blaming it on the temperature,

705
01:05:13,304 --> 01:05:15,604
熱い気持ちで未来を語ったり
Talking about the future with such hot feelings.

706
01:05:21,104 --> 01:05:23,304
( memories )

707
01:05:24,504 --> 01:05:29,004
どんなことでも冒険みたいになる
Making any adventure feel like a grand journey,

708
01:05:29,904 --> 01:05:34,604
期待値が上がってしまうシーズン
A season where expectations only rise.

709
01:05:35,304 --> 01:05:40,104
当たり前の日も特別ってこと
Even everyday days are something special—

710
01:05:40,504 --> 01:05:43,704
この瞬間、この一瞬だって
In this very moment, this very instant.

711
01:05:44,304 --> 01:05:46,904
だって思わせる
That's what I find myself thinking.

712
01:05:49,304 --> 01:05:52,904
賑わう人で混み合うほど
So crowded with people hustling about,

713
01:05:54,304 --> 01:05:58,304
何故だか楽しい気分だね
Why does it feel so strangely fun?

714
01:06:00,104 --> 01:06:04,204
動画の窓のような屋台
Like looking through the windows of a movie,

715
01:06:05,204 --> 01:06:09,204
一つ一つ覗いて
Peering into each and every one.

716
01:06:10,104 --> 01:06:14,004
一緒に一緒に歩こう
Let's walk together, side by side.

717
01:06:36,104 --> 01:06:37,604
振り返っても
Even if I look back,

718
01:06:38,904 --> 01:06:40,904
ほんのちょっとも
Just for a tiny second,

719
01:06:41,304 --> 01:06:45,704
トリミング出来ないようなシーンばっかり
It's full of scenes I just can't trim out.

720
01:06:46,704 --> 01:06:51,904
過ぎ去ってしてしまう前に もう一度だけ
Before it slips away, just one more time,

721
01:06:53,704 --> 01:06:58,904
みんなといたい
I want to be with everyone.

722
01:07:01,104 --> 01:07:04,704
想い出たちを彩るように
As if to color our memories,

723
01:07:06,304 --> 01:07:10,604
夜空に咲いた花火が
The fireworks blooming in the night sky

724
01:07:11,204 --> 01:07:16,104
色鮮やかに輝いてた
Were shining so brilliantly and bright.

725
01:07:17,104 --> 01:07:22,104
ずっと…一緒にいたいよ
I want to stay together... forever.

726
01:07:22,304 --> 01:07:27,604
来年もまたこんな風に 笑い合いたいって思うから
Hoping we can laugh together just like this next year too,

727
01:07:33,304 --> 01:07:37,904
線香花火に願うんだ
I make a wish upon a sparkler:

728
01:07:39,204 --> 01:07:44,304
「ずっと ずっと 続いて」
"Please, let this last and last."

729
01:07:44,604 --> 01:07:51,904
きっと きっと 叶う
I'm sure, I'm sure it will come true.

730
01:08:49,104 --> 01:08:49,904
Parade, Parade, Parade! 輝くんだよ
Parade, Parade, Parade! Let's make it shine.

731
01:08:50,904 --> 01:08:53,104
呼び合う声を 合図に
Using our calling voices as the cue.

732
01:08:53,304 --> 01:08:55,304
Parade, Parade, Parade! 探しにゆく
Parade, Parade, Parade! Let's go search.

733
01:08:55,704 --> 01:08:57,104
スタートは 何度だって
How many times was our start?

734
01:08:57,304 --> 01:08:58,304
ただ 独り言を呟いた
Just talking to ourselves,

735
01:08:58,704 --> 01:08:59,904
ただ 始まりりたくて走った
Just running because we wanted it to begin.

736
01:09:00,304 --> 01:09:01,904
遠く 暗がりでに灯った
Far away, a light flickered in the darkness.

737
01:09:02,504 --> 01:09:03,904
それは 眩し過ぎた名前
That was a name too dazzling,

738
01:09:04,304 --> 01:09:05,704
それは 優し過ぎる思い出もきっと
That was a memory too kind.

739
01:09:06,704 --> 01:09:08,604
近付けと 手を伸ばした
Reaching out our hands to get closer,

740
01:09:08,904 --> 01:09:10,604
思いがけず 結び合った
Unexpectedly, we became intertwined.

741
01:09:10,904 --> 01:09:12,704
ほら 今 迷子は “僕等” になった
Look, now the strays have become "us."

742
01:09:13,304 --> 01:09:15,104
Parade, Parade, Parade! 輝くんだよ
Parade, Parade, Parade! Let's make it shine.

743
01:09:15,104 --> 01:09:16,904
悔しさも 愛しさも 連れておいでよ
Bring your regrets and your love along with you.

744
01:09:17,104 --> 01:09:19,304
風、夢、羽 飛び立てるさ
Wind, dreams, and feathers take flight.

745
01:09:19,504 --> 01:09:21,904
ささやかな祈りは 光 終わり無い 兆し
A modest prayer is a light that never stops growing.

746
01:09:23,104 --> 01:09:25,004
君を見つけたこと 胸を張れるよ
Finding you lets me hold my head high.

747
01:09:25,304 --> 01:09:27,604
ここから これから our bright parade, parade!
From here and now, our bright parade!

748
01:09:28,104 --> 01:09:31,104
まだ 頼りない予感を 歌おう
Singing of yet uncertain premonitions,

749
01:09:31,304 --> 01:09:33,304
恥ずかしかくなんかないないよ
There's nothing to be embarrassed about.

750
01:09:33,904 --> 01:09:35,904
誰も解けない イマジナリー
An imaginary world nobody can solve.

751
01:09:36,604 --> 01:09:38,904
いつか また逢える おまじない
A spell to meet again someday.

752
01:09:39,604 --> 01:09:42,104
あの日ゼロに始まった ストーリー
A story that started at zero that day.

753
01:09:42,304 --> 01:09:44,304
数え切れない 言の葉
Countless leaves of words,

754
01:09:44,504 --> 01:09:46,604
数えられるような 想いじゃないさ
Not feelings that can be simply counted.

755
01:09:47,104 --> 01:09:49,304
ほら 今 “僕等” を一つと呼ぼう
Look, now let's call "us" a single whole.

756
01:09:50,104 --> 01:09:52,604
Parade, Parade, Parade! 美しいんだよ
Parade, Parade, Parade! It's so beautiful.

757
01:09:53,104 --> 01:09:55,604
許し合える 刹那 夜は きらめく
The fleeting night where we forgive each other sparkles.

758
01:09:56,304 --> 01:09:59,104
雨、晴れ、カレイド またとない空
Rain, shine, or kaleidoscope, a sky unlike any other.

759
01:10:00,212 --> 01:10:01,462
超えてく世界に見せてあげる
I'll show it to the world as we push past!

760
01:10:01,462 --> 01:10:03,712
世界に見せてあげる
I'll show it to the world!

761
01:10:03,712 --> 01:10:05,912
アクセスしてみたい
I want to try accessing it,

762
01:10:05,912 --> 01:10:08,012
後悔なんてさせない
and I won't let you regret it.

763
01:10:08,012 --> 01:10:10,212
それぞれ違ったココロで走れ go
Run with our own different hearts, go!

764
01:10:10,212 --> 01:10:12,412
それぞれ違ったココロで走れ go
Run with our own different hearts, go!

765
01:10:12,412 --> 01:10:15,112
それぞれ違ったココロで走れ go
Run with our own different hearts, go!

766
01:10:15,112 --> 01:10:17,362
走れ go
Run, go!

